    "sub_name": "AI基礎數學實習(一)",
    "sub_ename": "MATHEMATICS FOUNDATIONS OF ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE PRACTICE (1)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將涵蓋基本微積分等基礎數學概念及其應用介紹,以因應結合學程課程設計所需之數學觀念與計算能力為主要學習目標，建立微分與積分的等策略完成並以之探討實函數之局部性質與整體行徑。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will cover basic mathematics concepts such as basic calculus and its application introduction. The main learning objective is to combine the mathematical concepts and calculation skills required by the curriculum design of the course, to establish the strategies of differentiation and integration, and to explore the actual functions. Local nature and overall behavior.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
